### Houni n7ottou les variables elli bech nesta3mlouhom fel API
### Login w mot de passe mta3 manager nal9awhom fel fichier .env
@url = http://localhost:3000/api
@managerLogin = manager
@managerPassword = COLLE_MANAGER_PASSWORD

### 1) Tawa bech na3mlou compte jdid l user Ali
### El role dima user, 7atta ken nab3thou role ekher
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Ali", "login": "ali", "motDePasse": "123456" }

### 2) Tawa bech na3mlou login lel user Ali
### Ki yarja3lna token, ncopyiwah w n7ottouh fel tokenUser louta
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "ali", "motDePasse": "123456" }

### 3) Tawa bech na3mlou login lel manager
### 9bal lezem na3mlou npm run seed:manager bech yetcrea el manager
### Ba3d ncopyiw el token mta3ou w n7ottouh fel tokenManager 
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "{{managerLogin}}", "motDePasse": "{{managerPassword}}" }

### Houni bech n7ottou les tokens mta3 user w manager
### Kol token ncopyiwah mel reponse mta3 login
@tokenUser = COLLE_TOKEN_USER
@tokenManager = COLLE_TOKEN_MANAGER

### 4) Tawa el manager bech ychouf liste mta3 les users
### Lezem yarja3 200, w fiha nal9aw el id mta3 Ali
GET {{url}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenManager}}

### 5) Tawa el user bech yjareb ychouf liste mta3 les users
### Lezem yarja3 403 khater ken el manager 3andou el droit
GET {{url}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 6) Tawa el user bech ya3mel projet jdid esmou Site web
POST {{url}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{ "nom": "Site web", "description": "Refonte du site", "statut": "en cours" }

### 7) Tawa bech nchoufou les projets mta3 el user
### Bech nlawej 3la site w nrattbou les projets mel jdid lel 9dim
GET {{url}}/projects?search=site&sort=-createdAt
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 8) Tawa el manager bech ychouf les projets el kol
GET {{url}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenManager}}


### Houni n7ottou el id mta3 el projet w el id mta3 Ali
### Ncopyiw les ids mel reponses elli rja3oulna
@projectId = COLLE_ID_PROJET
@userId = COLLE_ID_USER

### 9) Tawa bech nzidou tache jdida fel projet
### El tache esmha Maquette w 3andha deadline
POST {{url}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{ "titre": "Maquette", "description": "Faire la maquette", "deadline": "2026-12-01" }

### 10) Tawa bech na3mlou tache men route /api/tasks
### El mara hedhi nab3thou el id mta3 projet fel body
POST {{url}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{ "titre": "Base de donnees", "projet": "{{projectId}}", "deadline": "2026-11-20" }

### 11) Tawa bech njarbou statut ghalet esmou fini
### Lezem el API trajja3 400 khater fini moch statut ma9boul
POST {{url}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{ "titre": "Test", "statut": "fini" }

### 12) Tawa bech nchoufou les taches mta3 projet
### Bech na3mlou filtre 3la todo w tri 7asb deadline
GET {{url}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?statut=todo&sort=deadline
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### 13) Tawa bech nlawejou 3la les taches elli fihom maquette
GET {{url}}/tasks?search=maquette
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### Houni n7ottou id mta3 tache elli bech nesta3mlouha
@taskId = COLLE_ID_TACHE

### 14) Tawa el user bech yjareb yaffecti tache l user ekher
### Lezem yarja3 403 khater el affectation ken lel manager

PATCH {{url}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{ "utilisateur": "{{userId}}" }


### 15) Tawa el manager bech yaffecti tache lel user Ali
### Lezem yarja3 200 khater el manager 3andou el droit
PATCH {{url}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenManager}}

{ "utilisateur": "{{userId}}" }

### 16) Tawa bech nbaddlou statut mta3 tache men todo lel doing
PUT {{url}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

{ "statut": "doing" }

### 17) Tawa bech nafs5ou tache mel projet
DELETE {{url}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
